{"id": "Dc8ojRUvOrL", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"PLUGINS\" to get these 4 Plugins to stop getting AI slop content.\n\nIf you're tired of your AI constantly producing the same generic AI slop, use these 4 free plugins to fix it.\n\nFirst use Impeccable for design.\n\nIt gives Claude real design taste pulled from premium references.\n\nYour UI stops looking vibe coded.\n\nAnd then combine it with 21st Dev MCP.\n\nYou get access to over 10,000 professional UI components and templates for apps and websites.\n\nThen use Humanizer for writing.\n\nIt removes all 33 tell tale signs of AI writing.\n\nIt also studies your writing style so everything it outputs sounds exactly like you.\n\nAnd finally Claude Code Setup for coding.\n\nIt's an official Anthropic plugin.\n\nIt scans your entire codebase and sets up the best hooks, skills, MCPs, and sub-agents your project needs.\n\nSo you start with a perfect setup built for your project.\n\nInstead of one with useless skills and MCPs cluttering everything up.\n\nTogether, these four cover design, components, writing, and setup, the four things that make AI output feel generic.\n\n#claudecode #aiplugins #aislop #aihumanizer #claudeai", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1788701039, "like_count": 2296, "comment_count": 3082, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1930969957905600a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.22, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPMHDDgRHuw806WIilg_XA5CVP2X8K-gVsAbd9RIv4mvUt37Q3TiE9BK249D0PqtgiMs0YWS1_BTNiynwrBdhh88m5xJodUzmXGaNA.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdpixuuyzClRji9cvAfatKVGIxJjTtX3rM_JZ-ZmXFexloYQ0-NC8_FZ1KfV1wJ-PI8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=pPJBLrHrFwgQ7kNvwGHWaxT&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=w4vOag-30fE